msgstr "Uporabite Pantoken shadcn register za ta projekt. Pridobite https://pantoken.app/r/registry.json, nato zaženite {{command}}, če projekt uporablja shadcn ali ima components.json. Elementi registra namestijo CSS in metapodatke, ne React komponent."

#: docs/.vitepress/i18n.json
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.chrome:agentTools.docsPrompt"
msgid "Fetch https://pantoken.app/llms.txt first. When a page is needed, prefer its raw Markdown URL by adding .md to the clean docs path, and use Pantoken manifests for component capabilities, CDN plugins, demos, and registry items."
msgstr "Najprej pridobite https://pantoken.app/llms.txt. Ko je potrebna stran, raje uporabite njeno surovo Markdown različico tako, da k čisti poti dokumentacije dodate .md, in uporabite Pantoken manifeste za zmogljivosti komponent, CDN vtičnike, demoe in elemente registra."

#: docs/.vitepress/i18n.json
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.chrome:agentTools.docsCommand"
msgid "Fetch https://pantoken.app/llms.txt, then follow links to the pages and manifests relevant to this task."
